# Loge: translations

```elixir
root = Path.expand("..", __DIR__)

Mix.install([
  {:loge, path: Path.join(root, "loge"), override: true},
  {:loge_tptp, path: Path.join(root, "loge_tptp")},
  {:loge_dimacs, path: Path.join(root, "loge_dimacs")},
  {:loge_asp, path: Path.join(root, "loge_asp")},
  {:loge_prolog, path: Path.join(root, "loge_prolog")},
  {:loge_egglog, path: Path.join(root, "loge_egglog")},
  {:loge_smtlib, path: Path.join(root, "loge_smtlib")},
  {:loge_turtle, path: Path.join(root, "loge_turtle")},
  {:kino_loge, path: Path.join(root, "kino_loge")}
])
```

A translation is an engine: a source in one language in, an outcome whose output is a
source in another. Its status is the relation it preserves between the two:

* **Equivalent**: input and output have the same models.
* **EquiSatisfiable**: one is satisfiable exactly when the other is.

So a verdict on the output is a verdict on the input: *unsatisfiable* carries back
under both relations, a model only under the first. An input outside the fragment a
translation is defined on gives **Inappropriate** with the reasons and no output;
nothing is translated by best effort. Bind an outcome to a name and the next cell
takes it as its input.

Most translations are written in Elixir and need nothing installed. Three run a
tool: `Clausify` runs **Vampire**, SMT-LIB to DIMACS runs **z3**, and ASP to DIMACS
grounds with the **clingo** that comes with the package. Vampire and z3 are found
on `PATH` or set in a Logic Engine Settings cell; cells that need one say so.

## Every edge

This table is read from the registry, so it lists what is installed.

```elixir
label = fn id ->
  case Loge.Registry.language(id) do
    {:ok, language} -> language.label()
    :error -> Atom.to_string(id)
  end
end

Loge.Registry.translations()
|> Enum.map(fn edge ->
  %{
    "from" => label.(edge.from),
    "to" => label.(edge.to),
    "engine" => edge.engine.label(),
    "preserves" => Loge.Status.name(edge.preserves),
    "module" => inspect(edge.engine)
  }
end)
|> Kino.DataTable.new(name: "Translations", keys: ["from", "to", "engine", "preserves", "module"])
```

| From | To | Engine | Fragment | Preserves | Needs |
| ---- | -- | ------ | -------- | --------- | ----- |
| DIMACS CNF | TPTP | `Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Tptp` | all | Equivalent | |
| DIMACS CNF | SMT-LIB | `Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Smtlib` | all | Equivalent | |
| DIMACS CNF | ASP | `Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Asp` | all | Equivalent | |
| WCNF | ASP | `Loge.Dimacs.Engines.WcnfAsp` | all | Equivalent | |
| QDIMACS | SMT-LIB | `Loge.Dimacs.Engines.QdimacsSmtlib` | all | Equivalent | |
| TPTP | TPTP (CNF) | `Loge.Tptp.Engines.Clausify` | FOF, CNF | EquiSatisfiable | Vampire |
| TPTP | TPTP (ground CNF) | `Loge.Tptp.Engines.Ground` | CNF without function symbols | EquiSatisfiable | |
| TPTP | TPTP (FOF) | `Loge.Tptp.Engines.Fof` | CNF, FOF | Equivalent | |
| TPTP | TPTP (TF0) | `Loge.Tptp.Engines.Tff` | FOF, CNF | Equivalent | |
| TPTP | TPTP (TH0) | `Loge.Tptp.Engines.Thf` | FOF, CNF, monomorphic TF0 | Equivalent | |
| TPTP | TPTP (FOF) | `Loge.Tptp.Engines.Untyped` | monomorphic TF0 without arithmetic | EquiSatisfiable | |
| TPTP | DIMACS CNF | `Loge.Tptp.Engines.Dimacs` | ground CNF without equality | EquiSatisfiable | |
| TPTP | SMT-LIB | `Loge.Tptp.Engines.Smtlib` | FOF, CNF, monomorphic TF0 | Equivalent | |
| TPTP | Prolog | `Loge.Tptp.Engines.Prolog` | Horn CNF without equality | Equivalent | |
| SMT-LIB | TPTP (TF0) | `Loge.Smtlib.Engines.Tptp` | Core with uninterpreted sorts and functions | Equivalent | |
| SMT-LIB | DIMACS CNF | `Loge.Smtlib.Engines.Dimacs` | propositional and bit-vector | EquiSatisfiable | z3 |
| ASP | DIMACS CNF | `Loge.Asp.Engines.Dimacs` | tight programs | EquiSatisfiable | |
| Prolog | TPTP | `Loge.Prolog.Engines.Tptp` | definite clauses | Equivalent | |
| Prolog | ASP | `Loge.Prolog.Engines.Asp` | Datalog | Equivalent | |
| Prolog | egglog | `Loge.Prolog.Engines.Egglog` | Datalog | Equivalent | |
| Turtle | TPTP | `Loge.Turtle.Engines.Tptp` | graphs in printable ASCII | EquiSatisfiable | |
| Turtle | Prolog | `Loge.Turtle.Engines.Prolog` | all | EquiSatisfiable | |
| Turtle | ASP | `Loge.Turtle.Engines.Asp` | all | EquiSatisfiable | |

There is no edge into Turtle, SPARQL or ShEx, out of egglog or out of THF, and none
for arithmetic. A pair without an engine has no row above.

## DIMACS

A formula, bound to `cnf`: satisfiable.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJsYW5ndWFnZSI6ImRpbWFjcyIsInNvdXJjZSI6InAgY25mIDMgM1xuMSAtMiAwXG4yIDMgMFxuLTEgLTMgMFxuIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiJjbmYifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.SourceCell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
cnf = Loge.source(:dimacs, "p cnf 3 3\n1 -2 0\n2 3 0\n-1 -3 0\n")
```

As TPTP clauses. Expected: **Equivalent**, three `cnf` statements over `p1`, `p2`, `p3`.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJkaW1hY3NfdHB0cCIsImlucHV0IjoiY25mIiwibGFuZ3VhZ2UiOiJkaW1hY3MiLCJvcHRpb25zIjp7fSwicm9sZXMiOnt9LCJzb3VyY2UiOiIiLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6ImNuZl9hc190cHRwIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
cnf_as_tptp = Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Tptp, cnf, [])
```

And back: ground clauses are a SAT problem again. Expected: **EquiSatisfiable**, then **Satisfiable**.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ0cHRwX2RpbWFjcyIsImlucHV0IjoiY25mX2FzX3RwdHAiLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6InRwdHAiLCJvcHRpb25zIjp7fSwicm9sZXMiOnt9LCJzb3VyY2UiOiIiLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6ImNuZl9hZ2FpbiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
cnf_again = Loge.run!(Loge.Tptp.Engines.Dimacs, cnf_as_tptp, [])
```

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGFzcCIsImlucHV0IjoiY25mX2FnYWluIiwibGFuZ3VhZ2UiOiJkaW1hY3MiLCJvcHRpb25zIjp7Im1vZGVscyI6MSwidGltZV9saW1pdCI6MTB9LCJyb2xlcyI6e30sInNvdXJjZSI6IiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Clasp, cnf_again, models: 1, time_limit: 10)
```

As an answer set program, solved by clingo. Expected: **Equivalent**, then **Satisfiable**.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJkaW1hY3NfYXNwIiwiaW5wdXQiOiJjbmYiLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6ImRpbWFjcyIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnt9LCJyb2xlcyI6e30sInNvdXJjZSI6IiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiY25mX2FzX2FzcCJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
cnf_as_asp = Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Asp, cnf, [])
```

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGluZ28iLCJpbnB1dCI6ImNuZl9hc19hc3AiLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6ImFzcCIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnsidGltZV9saW1pdCI6MTB9LCJyb2xlcyI6e30sInNvdXJjZSI6IiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Asp.Engines.Clingo, cnf_as_asp, time_limit: 10)
```

As an SMT-LIB script. Expected: **Equivalent**; z3 on it, if installed, answers **Satisfiable**.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJkaW1hY3Nfc210bGliIiwiaW5wdXQiOiJjbmYiLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6ImRpbWFjcyIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnt9LCJyb2xlcyI6e30sInNvdXJjZSI6IiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiY25mX2FzX3NtdGxpYiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
cnf_as_smtlib = Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Smtlib, cnf, [])
```

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ6MyIsImlucHV0IjoiY25mX2FzX3NtdGxpYiIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoic210bGliIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6eyJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoxMH0sInJvbGVzIjp7fSwic291cmNlIjoiIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiIifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Smtlib.Engines.Z3, cnf_as_smtlib, time_limit: 10)
```

Weighted MaxSAT as weak constraints. Expected: **Equivalent**, then clingo finds the optimum of cost 2.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ3Y25mX2FzcCIsImlucHV0IjpudWxsLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6IndjbmYiLCJvcHRpb25zIjp7fSwicm9sZXMiOnt9LCJzb3VyY2UiOiJoIDEgMiAwXG4zIC0xIDBcbjIgLTIgMFxuIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiJtYXhzYXRfYXNfYXNwIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
maxsat_as_asp = Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.WcnfAsp, "h 1 2 0\n3 -1 0\n2 -2 0\n", [])
```

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGluZ28iLCJpbnB1dCI6Im1heHNhdF9hc19hc3AiLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6ImFzcCIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnsidGltZV9saW1pdCI6MTB9LCJyb2xlcyI6e30sInNvdXJjZSI6IiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Asp.Engines.Clingo, maxsat_as_asp, time_limit: 10)
```

A quantified Boolean formula, here that x and y can always be made equal, as one quantified assertion. Expected: **Equivalent**; z3 answers **Satisfiable**, the formula is true.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJxZGltYWNzX3NtdGxpYiIsImlucHV0IjpudWxsLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6InFkaW1hY3MiLCJvcHRpb25zIjp7fSwicm9sZXMiOnt9LCJzb3VyY2UiOiJwIGNuZiAyIDJcbmEgMSAwXG5lIDIgMFxuLTEgMiAwXG4xIC0yIDBcbiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoicWJmX2FzX3NtdGxpYiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
qbf_as_smtlib =
  Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.QdimacsSmtlib, "p cnf 2 2\na 1 0\ne 2 0\n-1 2 0\n1 -2 0\n", [])
```

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ6MyIsImlucHV0IjoicWJmX2FzX3NtdGxpYiIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoic210bGliIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6eyJ0aW1lX2xpbWl0IjoxMH0sInJvbGVzIjp7fSwic291cmNlIjoiIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiIifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Smtlib.Engines.Z3, qbf_as_smtlib, time_limit: 10)
```

## TPTP: from a first-order problem to SAT

A theorem, bound to `problem`.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJsYW5ndWFnZSI6InRwdHAiLCJzb3VyY2UiOiJmb2YobW9ydGFscywgYXhpb20sICFbWF06IChodW1hbihYKSA9PiBtb3J0YWwoWCkpKS5cbmZvZihzb2NyYXRlcywgYXhpb20sIGh1bWFuKHNvY3JhdGVzKSkuXG5mb2Yoc29tZW9uZV9kaWVzLCBjb25qZWN0dXJlLCA/W1hdOiBtb3J0YWwoWCkpLlxuIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiJwcm9ibGVtIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.SourceCell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
problem =
  Loge.source(
    :tptp,
    "fof(mortals, axiom, ![X]: (human(X) => mortal(X))).\nfof(socrates, axiom, human(socrates)).\nfof(someone_dies, conjecture, ?[X]: mortal(X)).\n"
  )
```

Clauses, by Vampire (needs `vampire`). Expected: **EquiSatisfiable**; the conjecture is negated.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGF1c2lmeSIsImlucHV0IjoicHJvYmxlbSIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoidHB0cCIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnsidGltZV9saW1pdCI6MTB9LCJyb2xlcyI6e30sInNvdXJjZSI6IiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiY2xhdXNlcyJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
clauses = Loge.run!(Loge.Tptp.Engines.Clausify, problem, time_limit: 10)
```

Ground instances over the constants. Expected: **EquiSatisfiable**.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJncm91bmQiLCJpbnB1dCI6ImNsYXVzZXMiLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6InRwdHAiLCJvcHRpb25zIjp7fSwicm9sZXMiOnt9LCJzb3VyY2UiOiIiLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6Imdyb3VuZCJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
ground = Loge.run!(Loge.Tptp.Engines.Ground, clauses, [])
```

Ground atoms as variables. Expected: **EquiSatisfiable**, the atoms in `c` lines.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ0cHRwX2RpbWFjcyIsImlucHV0IjoiZ3JvdW5kIiwibGFuZ3VhZ2UiOiJ0cHRwIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6e30sInJvbGVzIjp7fSwic291cmNlIjoiIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiJzYXQifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
sat = Loge.run!(Loge.Tptp.Engines.Dimacs, ground, [])
```

Expected: **Unsatisfiable**, so the conjecture follows.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGFzcCIsImlucHV0Ijoic2F0IiwibGFuZ3VhZ2UiOiJkaW1hY3MiLCJvcHRpb25zIjp7Im1vZGVscyI6MSwidGltZV9saW1pdCI6MTB9LCJyb2xlcyI6e30sInNvdXJjZSI6IiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Clasp, sat, models: 1, time_limit: 10)
```

The clauses are Horn, so they are a Prolog program too. Expected: **Equivalent**, then **Yes** with `socrates` for the variable, which Vampire has renamed.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ0cHRwX3Byb2xvZyIsImlucHV0IjoiY2xhdXNlcyIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoidHB0cCIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnt9LCJyb2xlcyI6e30sInNvdXJjZSI6IiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiY2xhdXNlc19hc19wcm9sb2cifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
clauses_as_prolog = Loge.run!(Loge.Tptp.Engines.Prolog, clauses, [])
```

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJzd2lwbCIsImlucHV0IjoiY2xhdXNlc19hc19wcm9sb2ciLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6InByb2xvZyIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnsiYW5zd2VycyI6MSwidGltZV9saW1pdCI6MTB9LCJyb2xlcyI6e30sInNvdXJjZSI6IiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Prolog.Engines.Swipl, clauses_as_prolog, answers: 1, time_limit: 10)
```

The problem as an SMT-LIB script, the conjecture negated. Expected: **Equivalent**; z3 answers **Unsatisfiable**.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ0cHRwX3NtdGxpYiIsImlucHV0IjoicHJvYmxlbSIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoidHB0cCIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnt9LCJyb2xlcyI6e30sInNvdXJjZSI6IiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoicHJvYmxlbV9hc19zbXRsaWIifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
problem_as_smtlib = Loge.run!(Loge.Tptp.Engines.Smtlib, problem, [])
```

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ6MyIsImlucHV0IjoicHJvYmxlbV9hc19zbXRsaWIiLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6InNtdGxpYiIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnsidGltZV9saW1pdCI6MTB9LCJyb2xlcyI6e30sInNvdXJjZSI6IiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Smtlib.Engines.Z3, problem_as_smtlib, time_limit: 10)
```

## TPTP: between the dialects

Clauses as first-order formulas. Expected: **Equivalent**, each clause under its quantifier.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJmb2YiLCJpbnB1dCI6ImNsYXVzZXMiLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6InRwdHAiLCJvcHRpb25zIjp7fSwicm9sZXMiOnt9LCJzb3VyY2UiOiIiLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6IiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Tptp.Engines.Fof, clauses, [])
```

Untyped as typed first-order, and as typed higher-order with every symbol declared. Expected: **Equivalent** twice.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ0ZmYiLCJpbnB1dCI6InByb2JsZW0iLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6InRwdHAiLCJvcHRpb25zIjp7fSwicm9sZXMiOnt9LCJzb3VyY2UiOiIiLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6IiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Tptp.Engines.Tff, problem, [])
```

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ0aGYiLCJpbnB1dCI6InByb2JsZW0iLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6InRwdHAiLCJvcHRpb25zIjp7fSwicm9sZXMiOnt9LCJzb3VyY2UiOiIiLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6IiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Tptp.Engines.Thf, problem, [])
```

A typed problem, bound to `typed`.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.SourceCell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
typed =
  Loge.source(
    :tptp,
    "tff(human_type, type, human: $tType).\ntff(socrates_type, type, socrates: human).\ntff(father_type, type, father: human > human).\ntff(mortal_type, type, mortal: human > $o).\ntff(inherited, axiom, ![X: human]: (mortal(father(X)) => mortal(X))).\ntff(first, axiom, mortal(father(socrates))).\ntff(goal, conjecture, mortal(socrates)).\n"
  )
```

Without its types: each type a guard predicate. Expected: **EquiSatisfiable**.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ1bnR5cGVkIiwiaW5wdXQiOiJ0eXBlZCIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoidHB0cCIsIm9wdGlvbnMiOnt9LCJyb2xlcyI6e30sInNvdXJjZSI6IiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiZ3VhcmRlZCJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
guarded = Loge.run!(Loge.Tptp.Engines.Untyped, typed, [])
```

The typed problem in TH0 and as SMT-LIB with a sort per type. Expected: **Equivalent** twice; z3 answers **Unsatisfiable**.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ0aGYiLCJpbnB1dCI6InR5cGVkIiwibGFuZ3VhZ2UiOiJ0cHRwIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6e30sInJvbGVzIjp7fSwic291cmNlIjoiIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiIifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Tptp.Engines.Thf, typed, [])
```

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ0cHRwX3NtdGxpYiIsImlucHV0IjoidHlwZWQiLCJsYW5ndWFnZSI6InRwdHAiLCJvcHRpb25zIjp7fSwicm9sZXMiOnt9LCJzb3VyY2UiOiIiLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6InR5cGVkX2FzX3NtdGxpYiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
typed_as_smtlib = Loge.run!(Loge.Tptp.Engines.Smtlib, typed, [])
```

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJ6MyIsImlucHV0IjoidHlwZWRfYXNfc210bGliIiwibGFuZ3VhZ2UiOiJzbXRsaWIiLCJvcHRpb25zIjp7InRpbWVfbGltaXQiOjEwfSwicm9sZXMiOnt9LCJzb3VyY2UiOiIiLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6IiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Smtlib.Engines.Z3, typed_as_smtlib, time_limit: 10)
```

## SMT-LIB

Uninterpreted sorts and functions as TF0. Expected: **Equivalent**, a type per sort.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(
  Loge.Smtlib.Engines.Tptp,
  "(declare-sort S 0)\n(declare-const a S)\n(declare-fun f (S) S)\n(declare-fun p (S) Bool)\n(assert (forall ((x S)) (= (f x) x)))\n(assert (p a))\n(assert (not (p (f (f a)))))\n(check-sat)\n",
  []
)
```

Bit-vectors as clauses, by z3 (needs `z3`): is there an x with x + 1 = 0 in two bits? Expected: **EquiSatisfiable**, then clasp answers **Satisfiable**.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
bits =
  Loge.run!(
    Loge.Smtlib.Engines.Dimacs,
    "(set-logic QF_BV)\n(declare-const x (_ BitVec 2))\n(assert (= (bvadd x #b01) #b00))\n(check-sat)\n",
    time_limit: 10
  )
```

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGFzcCIsImlucHV0IjoiYml0cyIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoiZGltYWNzIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6eyJtb2RlbHMiOjEsInRpbWVfbGltaXQiOjEwfSwicm9sZXMiOnt9LCJzb3VyY2UiOiIiLCJ2YXJpYWJsZSI6IiJ9","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Clasp, bits, models: 1, time_limit: 10)
```

## ASP

A tight program, two nodes to colour, completed to SAT. Expected: **EquiSatisfiable**, then **Satisfiable** with the two colourings among the models.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
colouring =
  Loge.run!(
    Loge.Asp.Engines.Dimacs,
    "node(1..2). edge(1, 2).\n{ red(X) } :- node(X).\ngreen(X) :- node(X), not red(X).\n:- edge(X, Y), red(X), red(Y).\n:- edge(X, Y), green(X), green(Y).\n",
    time_limit: 10
  )
```

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJjbGFzcCIsImlucHV0IjoiY29sb3VyaW5nIiwibGFuZ3VhZ2UiOiJkaW1hY3MiLCJvcHRpb25zIjp7Im1vZGVscyI6MCwidGltZV9saW1pdCI6MTB9LCJyb2xlcyI6e30sInNvdXJjZSI6IiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoiIn0","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Loge.run!(Loge.Dimacs.Engines.Clasp, colouring, models: 0, time_limit: 10)
```

## Prolog

Datalog with a left-recursive rule, bound to `paths`: Prolog's own search does not end on it.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJsYW5ndWFnZSI6InByb2xvZyIsInNvdXJjZSI6ImVkZ2UoYSwgYikuIGVkZ2UoYiwgYykuIGVkZ2UoYywgZCkuXG5wYXRoKFgsIFkpIDotIHBhdGgoWCwgWiksIGVkZ2UoWiwgWSkuXG5wYXRoKFgsIFkpIDotIGVkZ2UoWCwgWSkuXG4/LSBwYXRoKGEsIFdoZXJlKS5cbiIsInZhcmlhYmxlIjoicGF0aHMifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.SourceCell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
paths =
  Loge.source(
    :prolog,
    "edge(a, b). edge(b, c). edge(c, d).\npath(X, Y) :- path(X, Z), edge(Z, Y).\npath(X, Y) :- edge(X, Y).\n?- path(a, Where).\n"
  )
```

Bottom-up in egglog. Expected: **Equivalent**; the run prints the three answers and is **Success**.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJwcm9sb2dfZWdnbG9nIiwiaW5wdXQiOiJwYXRocyIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoicHJvbG9nIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6e30sInJvbGVzIjp7fSwic291cmNlIjoiIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiJwYXRoc19hc19lZ2dsb2cifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

