As an answer set program, the query a constraint. Expected: **Equivalent**, then **Unsatisfiable**: the query has an answer.

<!-- livebook:{"attrs":"eyJlbmdpbmUiOiJwcm9sb2dfYXNwIiwiaW5wdXQiOiJwYXRocyIsImxhbmd1YWdlIjoicHJvbG9nIiwib3B0aW9ucyI6e30sInJvbGVzIjp7fSwic291cmNlIjoiIiwidmFyaWFibGUiOiJwYXRoc19hc19hc3AifQ","chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.KinoLoge.Cell","livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

